            "title": "State-wise Details of Integrated Aquaparks approved under Pradhan Mantri Matsya Sampada Yojana (PMMSY) from 2020-21 to 2024-25",
            "description": "This dataset provides state-wise information on Integrated Aquaparks approved across India under the Pradhan Mantri Matsya Sampada Yojana (PMMSY) during the financial years 2020-21 to 2024-25. The dataset includes details such as the number of aquaparks approved in each state, the total project cost, and the share of funding contributed by the Government of India. These aquaparks are designed to support holistic development of the fisheries sector by integrating infrastructure for production, processing, storage, marketing, and export of fish and aquaculture products. The data serves as a valuable resource for policymakers, researchers, and stakeholders in the fisheries and aquaculture industry to monitor regional investments and growth initiatives under PMMSY.",
